  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building effective advocacy approaches on Women&apos;s Economic Empowerment and Care</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will focus on working with partners including the media, care champions in the communities and social influencers in a bid to shift social norms around unpaid care and domestic work at all levels, creating an enabling environment that views unpaid care and domestic work as an economic, development and gender equality issue as opposed to a private issue and policy advocacy to influence development and adoption of policies which advance unpaid care and domestic work agenda.</narrative>
  </description>
